{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37766","headline":"同志顾云下第出京偶有寄勉 · 郑谷","name":"同志顾云下第出京偶有寄勉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤策联华是国华，春来偶未上仙槎。\n乡连南渡思菰米，泪滴东风避杏花。\n吟聒暮莺归庙院，睡消迟日寄僧家。\n一般情绪应相信，门静莎深树影斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}